.TH INODUNE\-CLI 1 "2026-11-02" "inodune 0.1.11" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inodune\-cli \- Inodune command line: scan and clean local caches
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B inodune\-cli
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read-only scan with \fBscan\fR, cleanup plans with \fBclean\fR
(\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR, \fB\-\-safe\fR, \fB\-\-review\fR \fIdetector\fR,
\fB\-\-permanent\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR) and the installed software inventory with
\fBapps list\fR. Run \fBinodune\-cli \-\-help\fR for every option. Exit 2 means
error; exit 3 means partial coverage or partial execution.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/caiolombello/inodune
